<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage at 7.866 bln rand Sat.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage at 7.866 bln rand Sat.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said the money market shortage eased to 7.866 billion rand on Saturday from 7.910 billion rand on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
